hambore falls to Alauddin.","m":7,"cp":"chahamanas-of-ranastambhapura","cpn":"Chahamanas of Ranastambhapura","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":3},{"y":1303,"t":"gain","x":"1303: Alauddin takes Chittor.","cp":"guhilas-of-mewar","cpn":"Guhilas of Mewar","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":3},{"y":1304,"t":"gain","x":"1304: Gujarat is annexed.","cp":"chaulukya-dynasty","cpn":"Chaulukya dynasty","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":2},{"y":1305,"t":"gain","x":"1305: Malwa falls.","cp":"paramara-dynasty","cpn":"Paramara dynasty","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":3},{"y":1308,"t":"contest_start","x":"1308: Malik Kafur marches on Devagiri.","cp":"yadava-dynasty","cpn":"Yadava dynasty of Devagiri","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":2},{"y":1308,"t":"contest_end","x":"1308: Ramachandra submits, and the war ends the same year.","cp":"yadava-dynasty","cpn":"Yadava dynasty of Devagiri","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":2},{"y":1308,"t":"vassal_start","x":"1308: the Yadavas become Delhi's tributaries.","cp":"yadava-dynasty","cpn":"Yadava dynasty of Devagiri","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":2},{"y":1308,"t":"gain","x":"1308: Siwana falls.","m":11,"cp":"chahamanas-of-jalor","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":3},{"y":1310,"t":"contest_start","x":"1310: Malik Kafur besieges Warangal.","cp":"kakatiya-dynasty","cpn":"Kakatiya dynasty","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":3},{"y":1310,"t":"contest_end","x":"1310: Prataparudra submits after the siege.","cp":"kakatiya-dynasty","cpn":"Kakatiya dynasty","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":3},{"y":1310,"t":"vassal_start","x":"1310: the Kakatiyas become tributaries.","cp":"kakatiya-dynasty","cpn":"Kakatiya dynasty","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":3},{"y":1311,"t":"contest_start","x":"1311: Malik Kafur attacks Dwarasamudra.","cp":"hoysala-kingdom","cpn":"Hoysala Kingdom","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":3},{"y":1311,"t":"contest_end","x":"1311: Ballala III makes terms after a short siege.","cp":"hoysala-kingdom","cpn":"Hoysala Kingdom","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":3},{"y":1311,"t":"vassal_start","x":"1311: the Hoysalas become tributaries.","cp":"hoysala-kingdom","cpn":"Hoysala Kingdom","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":3},{"y":1311,"t":"gain","x":"1311: Jalore falls.","cp":"chahamanas-of-jalor","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":3},{"y":1313,"t":"vassal_end","x":"1313: the Yadava tribute ends in annexation (see the gain of the same year).","cp":"yadava-dynasty","cpn":"Yadava dynasty of Devagiri","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":3},{"y":1313,"t":"gain","x":"1313: Devagiri is annexed.","cp":"yadava-dynasty","cpn":"Yadava dynasty of Devagiri","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":2},{"y":1316,"t":"loss","x":"1316: Devagiri breaks away.","cp":"yadava-dynasty","cpn":"Yadava dynasty of Devagiri","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qutbuddin_Mubarak_Shah","c":1},{"y":1317,"t":"gain","x":"1317: Mubarak Shah retakes Devagiri.","m":4,"cp":"yadava-dynasty","cpn":"Yadava dynasty of Devagiri","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qutbuddin_Mubarak_Shah","c":3},{"y":1320,"t":"vassal_end","x":"1320: the Kakatiya tribute ends with the dynasty.","cp":"kakatiya-dynasty","cpn":"Kakatiya dynasty","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":1},{"y":1320,"t":"vassal_end","x":"1320: the Hoysala tribute is closed with the dynasty; the pages opened do not say when the Hoysalas stopped paying.","cp":"hoysala-kingdom","cpn":"Hoysala Kingdom","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","c":1},{"y":1320,"t":"dissolve","x":"1320: the Khalji dynasty ends.","m":7,"cp":"tughlaq-dynasty","cpn":"Tughlaq dynasty","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qutbuddin_Mubarak_Shah","c":3}],"wars":[{"name":"Khalji conquest of Gujarat","from":1299,"to":1304,"outcome":"Raid in early 1299 (Ulugh Khan, Nusrat Khan), annexation of the Vaghela kingdom in 1304.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji"},{"name":"Siege of Ranthambore","from":1301,"to":1301,"outcome":"Fort conquered in July 1301 after Nusrat Khan was killed; Alauddin led the siege himself.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji"},{"name":"Siege of Chittorgarh","from":1303,"to":1303,"outcome":"Chittor conquered after a siege of eight months.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji"},{"name":"Khalji conquest of Malwa","from":1305,"to":1305,"outcome":"Mahalakadeva killed; Malwa a province under Ayn al-Mulk Multani.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji"},{"name":"Khalji conquest of Siwana and Jalore","from":1308,"to":1311,"outcome":"Siwana taken in the autumn of 1308 (Sitaladeva killed in November); Jalore captured in 1311 (Kanhadadeva killed).","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji"},{"name":"Mongol invasions of India under Alauddin","from":1297,"to":1306,"outcome":"Khalji victories at Jaran-Manjur (6 February 1298), over the Sindh raiders (1298-99), at Kili (1299, Zafar Khan killed), at Amroha (1305) and on the Ravi (1306); the siege of Delhi in August 1303 was abandoned.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji"},{"name":"Malik Kafur's southern campaigns","from":1308,"to":1313,"outcome":"Yadavas (1308), Kakatiyas (1310) and Hoysalas (1311) become tributaries; Madurai raided in 1311 without a submission; Devagiri annexed in 1313.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji"},{"name":"Mubarak Shah's reconquest of Devagiri","from":1317,"to":1317,"outcome":"Harapaladeva's rising crushed; Devagiri under a governor again.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qutbuddin_Mubarak_Shah"}],"certainty":[{"from":1290,"to":1320,"level":"soft","note":"Every frontier is approximate: the pages give cities, forts and kingdoms, not boundaries."}],"sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khalji_dynasty","title":"Khalji dynasty"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alauddin_Khalji","title":"Alauddin Khalji"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delhi_Sultanate","title":"Delhi Sultanate"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qutbuddin_Mubarak_Shah","title":"Qutbuddin Mubarak Shah"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karnat_dynasty","title":"Karnat dynasty"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bundi_State","title":"Bundi State"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaipur_State","title":"Jaipur State"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kalachuris_of_Ratnapura","title":"Kalachuris of Ratnapura"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soomra_dynasty","title":"Soomra dynasty"}]}